title: Citrix DDC Statistics
agents: citrix_ddc_rest
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 This service reports the health of the Citrix DDC REST special agent run
 itself (authentication, site-ID lookup, Machines/Sessions polling against
 the Delivery Controller). It is created on the host running the special
 agent, not on the piggyback hosts (Delivery Controller is usually the
 agent's own host in Setup; the piggyback hosts only carry the
 citrix_state/citrix_serverload/citrix_sessions/citrix_hostsystem data).

 Goes CRIT when the agent run failed (authentication, HTTP error, timeout)
 with the underlying error message as the service output. Goes OK when the
 run succeeded, reporting the number of machines and sessions retrieved and
 the query duration.

item:
 None. One "Citrix DDC Statistics" service is created per configured host.

discovery:
 One "Citrix DDC Statistics" service is discovered on the host running the
 special agent.
